# Version-control compatibility pointer

Follow the current solo-development override in
[`../../AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md), the delivery process in
[`../../docs/WORKFLOW.md`](../../docs/WORKFLOW.md), and version semantics in
[`../../docs/VERSIONING.md`](../../docs/VERSIONING.md). D32 authorizes direct
verified commits and pushes to `main` plus native public-stand deployment until
the user explicitly revokes it. An authorized product release includes its
mandatory SemVer bump under [`WORKFLOW.md#product-versioning`](../../docs/WORKFLOW.md#product-versioning);
the standalone documentation stage does not. D32 never authorizes force-push,
tag, reset, secrets or infrastructure changes.
